                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I have changed my review to a recomend, as I think this game could be on the way to something excellent and the developers are listenting and responding. If its on sale then also worth a look.\n\nI have two main hobbies, drone flying in real life and VR and I thought this programme could be an excellent best of both worlds. Maybe I am looking in the wrong place and what I want is a drone simulator, but I find the controls annoying. I would prefer an XBOX controller option that allows me to fly the drone like my real life one, so that I dont have to learn all over again, and because I think they are designed how they are for good reason. I also think the position and control of the drone should be important to the firing. The employed mechanism mean you could sit somewhere in a hover and only use the shoot option which then makes it like SPT. You would only need to fly to avoid being hit. If the guns were fixed so you had to aim the drone I think that would be better. Has potential but I think probably not for real drone flyers.",
                        "timestamp_created": 1492824943,
